(4889249, 710079, 85561, '<td valign="top">I''m distracted by the reflection on his back, but this has a nice fairytale feel...</td>', 'I''m distracted by the reflection on his back, but this has a nice fairytale feel...', '2008-08-14 19:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
