(4889255, 710114, 55838, '<td valign="top">Very cute - one of my favorites of the challenge.  8</td>', 'Very cute - one of my favorites of the challenge.  8', '2008-08-14 19:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889257, 710072, 85561, '<td valign="top">Well caught</td>', 'Well caught', '2008-08-14 19:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889258, 710137, 55838, '<td valign="top">A great perspective shot.  Very nice and one of my highest votes.</td>', 'A great perspective shot.  Very nice and one of my highest votes.', '2008-08-14 19:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889260, 709788, 85561, '<td valign="top">A scene from The Big Lebowski?</td>', 'A scene from The Big Lebowski?', '2008-08-14 19:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889261, 710072, 55838, '<td valign="top">I was hoping to see more spoofs of past ribbon winners - fun.  I would have done one myslef but didn''t have time to shoot for DPC this week.  Very nicely done...probably the blue.</td>', 'I was hoping to see more spoofs of past ribbon winners - fun.  I would have done one myslef but didn''t have time to shoot for DPC this week.  Very nicely done...probably the blue.', '2008-08-14 19:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889262, 708972, 85561, '<td valign="top">I feel dirty...</td>', 'I feel dirty...', '2008-08-14 19:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889265, 710232, 85561, '<td valign="top">I wonder if a fill flash might have helped this...</td>', 'I wonder if a fill flash might have helped this...', '2008-08-14 19:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889266, 710079, 55838, '<td valign="top">There is just something about this image that I really like.  It''s quiet and it''s cool that the turtle is looking at Woody.  Great woody posing.  Well done.</td>', 'There is just something about this image that I really like.  It''s quiet and it''s cool that the turtle is looking at Woody.  Great woody posing.  Well done.', '2008-08-14 19:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889269, 709891, 85561, '<td valign="top">Not sure the drop helps this photo...</td>', 'Not sure the drop helps this photo...', '2008-08-14 19:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889276, 708757, 85561, '<td valign="top">Scary</td>', 'Scary', '2008-08-14 20:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889280, 710165, 85561, '<td valign="top">Possibly a Cyberman from Doctor Who...</td>', 'Possibly a Cyberman from Doctor Who...', '2008-08-14 20:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889282, 710149, 85561, '<td valign="top">Very nice this</td>', 'Very nice this', '2008-08-14 20:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889397, 708796, 45475, '<td valign="top">Of course, there HAD to be a stand off some time, eh? I like the idea and the backdrop is fun. <br/> <br/>A few issues I see with it though:<br/> <br/>1. I think you''ve just missed the focus on the subjects, it seems to be on the bg. Even still, the entire photograph looks soft so you may want to sharpen as your last pp step before save for web;<br/> <br/>2. The colours look flat, a bit of added contrast would help;<br/> <br/>3. Over-exposure, particularly on the wooden doll''s head and arms;<br/> <br/>4. The composition is static and claustrophobic. A different angle would have made this more dynamic. Also the characters are close to the edge of frame - the crop is too tight.</td>', 'Of course, there HAD to be a stand off some time, eh? I like the idea and the backdrop is fun.  A few issues I see with it though: 1. I think you''ve just missed the focus on the subjects, it seems to be on the bg. Even still, the entire photograph looks soft so you may want to sharpen as your last pp step before save for web; 2. The colours look flat, a bit of added contrast would help; 3. Over-exposure, particularly on the wooden doll''s head and arms; 4. The composition is static and claustrophobic. A different angle would have made this more dynamic. Also the characters are close to the edge of frame - the crop is too tight.', '2008-08-14 21:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889603, 710137, 81362, '<td valign="top">Very well composed. The solid wall of large repeating stone pattern isolates woody effectively and contributes to the mood.</td>', 'Very well composed. The solid wall of large repeating stone pattern isolates woody effectively and contributes to the mood.', '2008-08-14 23:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889716, 709039, 94614, '<td valign="top">AWESOME!!! My Favorite of this entire challenge... hope you get a ribbon for this :) I''m dying laughing- and its not only funny- but well composed, lit, great focus... 9!</td>', 'AWESOME!!! My Favorite of this entire challenge... hope you get a ribbon for this :) I''m dying laughing- and its not only funny- but well composed, lit, great focus... 9!', '2008-08-15 01:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889720, 710137, 94614, '<td valign="top">Simple and beautiful, one of the only photos where Woody isn''t filling up the whole picture- but all the more powerful for it. Great concept. Great shot.</td>', 'Simple and beautiful, one of the only photos where Woody isn''t filling up the whole picture- but all the more powerful for it. Great concept. Great shot.', '2008-08-15 01:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889721, 710105, 94614, '<td valign="top">Loved this! Great concept. Very funny and well shot. The crop on the top was a little close to woody''s head for comfort, but I''m assuming that something distracting was lurking just outside of the shot... Definitely one of my top favorites... good luck! 8!</td>', 'Loved this! Great concept. Very funny and well shot. The crop on the top was a little close to woody''s head for comfort, but I''m assuming that something distracting was lurking just outside of the shot... Definitely one of my top favorites... good luck! 8!', '2008-08-15 01:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889727, 710052, 94614, '<td valign="top">Utterly amazing shot. Beautiful lighting, detail and very imaginative concept. 9!</td>', 'Utterly amazing shot. Beautiful lighting, detail and very imaginative concept. 9!', '2008-08-15 02:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889729, 708275, 94614, '<td valign="top">So imaginative it hurts! others tried the whole woody birth/procreation theme- but nobody carried it off anywhere near as well as you! Liked the composition, lighting and the crop. Also like how the diagonals of the wood help give the phot more energy and movement- This must have been a LOT of work! well Done. 9</td>', 'So imaginative it hurts! others tried the whole woody birth/procreation theme- but nobody carried it off anywhere near as well as you! Liked the composition, lighting and the crop. Also like how the diagonals of the wood help give the phot more energy and movement- This must have been a LOT of work! well Done. 9', '2008-08-15 02:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889731, 709954, 94614, '<td valign="top">very fun and imaginative!</td>', 'very fun and imaginative!', '2008-08-15 02:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889732, 710079, 94614, '<td valign="top">Darn it - that just makes me go awwww! who doesn''t love those little turtles? Good job shooting with somewhat harsh lighting.</td>', 'Darn it - that just makes me go awwww! who doesn''t love those little turtles? Good job shooting with somewhat harsh lighting.', '2008-08-15 02:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889868, 710114, 47791, '<td valign="top">Good idea but I''d like to see stronger colours.</td>', 'Good idea but I''d like to see stronger colours.', '2008-08-15 06:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889870, 709847, 47791, '<td valign="top">Very good. Nice perspectives used.</td>', 'Very good. Nice perspectives used.', '2008-08-15 06:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889887, 710156, 96721, '<td valign="top">Good picture the woody is posed really really nicely and mimics C-3P0 very well, however I would have given a bit of a higher score had you used an R2-D2 model</td>', 'Good picture the woody is posed really really nicely and mimics C-3P0 very well, however I would have given a bit of a higher score had you used an R2-D2 model', '2008-08-15 07:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889890, 710149, 96721, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here, although I find the texture on the wall distracting and also the lighting is too strong and the fall off from it is a bit too harsh top left for my liking.<br/> <br/>A nice original idea though and well done on making the shadow look very realistic.</td>', 'I like the composition here, although I find the texture on the wall distracting and also the lighting is too strong and the fall off from it is a bit too harsh top left for my liking. A nice original idea though and well done on making the shadow look very realistic.', '2008-08-15 08:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889892, 709510, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed shot.<br/> <br/>I would have liked the pose to be a little more realistic though maybe the hands turned up as if holding the "log"</td>', 'Nicely composed shot. I would have liked the pose to be a little more realistic though maybe the hands turned up as if holding the "log"', '2008-08-15 08:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889893, 709831, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.<br/> <br/> I would have liked to see this cropped a bit more at the bottom and if possible a little more headroom as the shadow / reflection of the duck adds nothing to the image but the composition feels weaker with the woody being so high in the frame and level with the ducks.</td>', 'Nice lighting.  I would have liked to see this cropped a bit more at the bottom and if possible a little more headroom as the shadow / reflection of the duck adds nothing to the image but the composition feels weaker with the woody being so high in the frame and level with the ducks.', '2008-08-15 08:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889894, 709931, 96721, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better with a tight crop left and posted in portrait or even square, as cropping out the lit area to the left would add a lot of tension to the shot and make it far more dramatic.</td>', 'I think this would have worked better with a tight crop left and posted in portrait or even square, as cropping out the lit area to the left would add a lot of tension to the shot and make it far more dramatic.', '2008-08-15 08:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889895, 707932, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and well lit shot</td>', 'Nicely composed and well lit shot', '2008-08-15 08:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889903, 710015, 96721, '<td valign="top">The pose looks a little strange although I suspect the right hand is covering the head from the onslaught of rain? a mocked up newspaper or similar would have emphasised this if so.<br/> <br/>I would have liked to see more realistic rain drops (ie not one stream of water maybe the use of a spray head from a watering can would have allowed accurate enough positioning without the single line of water drops.</td>', 'The pose looks a little strange although I suspect the right hand is covering the head from the onslaught of rain? a mocked up newspaper or similar would have emphasised this if so. I would have liked to see more realistic rain drops (ie not one stream of water maybe the use of a spray head from a watering can would have allowed accurate enough positioning without the single line of water drops.', '2008-08-15 08:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889904, 708118, 96721, '<td valign="top">How dramatic this would have been shot outside with a junglesque backdrop the lean in the pose adds tension and the feeling of cautious movement, nice work</td>', 'How dramatic this would have been shot outside with a junglesque backdrop the lean in the pose adds tension and the feeling of cautious movement, nice work', '2008-08-15 08:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889906, 708079, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but the scale of the ladder is way off, a smaller ladder and some detail at the top of the picture (maybe the lower roof line or some guttering) would have made this image much stronger.</td>', 'Nice idea but the scale of the ladder is way off, a smaller ladder and some detail at the top of the picture (maybe the lower roof line or some guttering) would have made this image much stronger.', '2008-08-15 08:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889912, 709992, 96721, '<td valign="top">Amazing perspective and great pose on the Woody, one o fmy favorite shots in the challenge.</td>', 'Amazing perspective and great pose on the Woody, one o fmy favorite shots in the challenge.', '2008-08-15 08:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889913, 709039, 96721, '<td valign="top">One of the most creative images in the challenge IMO!<br/> <br/>Nit picking really but I would have preferred the he he he left out of the title.</td>', 'One of the most creative images in the challenge IMO! Nit picking really but I would have preferred the he he he left out of the title.', '2008-08-15 08:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889916, 709887, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot<br/> <br/>Good DOF and I like the leading hand being blurred it almost gives a feeling of movement, if I''m honest I''m not sure the ant is needed, in fact I think it detracts from the overall picture.</td>', 'Nice Shot Good DOF and I like the leading hand being blurred it almost gives a feeling of movement, if I''m honest I''m not sure the ant is needed, in fact I think it detracts from the overall picture.', '2008-08-15 08:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889918, 709149, 96721, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the tones in the picture give off a warm feeling so the title doesn''t portray cold water to me. Also from the angle of the shot the Woody looks completely out of place on the steps.</td>', 'Unfortunately the tones in the picture give off a warm feeling so the title doesn''t portray cold water to me. Also from the angle of the shot the Woody looks completely out of place on the steps.', '2008-08-15 08:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889920, 710218, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nice use of props, title and pose.</td>', 'Nice use of props, title and pose.', '2008-08-15 08:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889923, 709847, 96721, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and execution, although the tatty torn cape detracts a bit from the image, this actually works slightly better with the tear and part of the foot cropped off, would have been awesome if you could have added some motion blur somehow!</td>', 'Clever idea and execution, although the tatty torn cape detracts a bit from the image, this actually works slightly better with the tear and part of the foot cropped off, would have been awesome if you could have added some motion blur somehow!', '2008-08-15 08:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889924, 709311, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and posing of the 2 standing characters would have liked to see the "new brother" posed with both arms outstretched personally.</td>', 'Nice DOF and posing of the 2 standing characters would have liked to see the "new brother" posed with both arms outstretched personally.', '2008-08-15 08:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889925, 708842, 96721, '<td valign="top">For a pair of wooden toys you have done amazingly well to add real feeling into this image, really nice.<br/> <br/>Just a little nitpick would be the back arm looks a little out of place (awkward).<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'For a pair of wooden toys you have done amazingly well to add real feeling into this image, really nice. Just a little nitpick would be the back arm looks a little out of place (awkward). 8', '2008-08-15 08:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889930, 708232, 96721, '<td valign="top">Looks more like he is break dancing :)<br/> <br/>An idea of what caused the slip would have added to the overall shot I feel as at the moment the pose really doesn''t portray a slip more a fall from a higher position.</td>', 'Looks more like he is break dancing :) An idea of what caused the slip would have added to the overall shot I feel as at the moment the pose really doesn''t portray a slip more a fall from a higher position.', '2008-08-15 09:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889931, 709970, 96721, '<td valign="top">Water droplets on wire mesh?<br/> <br/>Unique idea just not sure it works for me, maybe more DOF would have helped.</td>', 'Water droplets on wire mesh? Unique idea just not sure it works for me, maybe more DOF would have helped.', '2008-08-15 09:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4889935, 710149, 76843, '<td valign="top">great composition! I luv that the shadow is the focus, and i like that your woodys have faces...very cool!   10;)</td>', 'great composition! I luv that the shadow is the focus, and i like that your woodys have faces...very cool!   10;)', '2008-08-15 09:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4890048, 710170, 96721, '<td valign="top">The white balance seems a little off? Kind of a blue cast over the whole image.</td>', 'The white balance seems a little off? Kind of a blue cast over the whole image.', '2008-08-15 10:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4890052, 709928, 96721, '<td valign="top">Good idea let down a little by the awkward poses, also would have been better with the canvas &amp; easel rotated I think.</td>', 'Good idea let down a little by the awkward poses, also would have been better with the canvas & easel rotated I think.', '2008-08-15 10:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4890064, 708484, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, I think the model needed to be separated from the backdrop more and maybe a smaller DOF to blur the highlights more would have worked well.<br/> <br/>A little untidy with the glue on the waistcoat which is quite distracting.</td>', 'Nice idea, I think the model needed to be separated from the backdrop more and maybe a smaller DOF to blur the highlights more would have worked well. A little untidy with the glue on the waistcoat which is quite distracting.', '2008-08-15 10:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4890272, 709766, 37719, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the execution is pretty good.  I guess my only real disappointment is the woodies are still on the bases.</td>', 'I like the idea and the execution is pretty good.  I guess my only real disappointment is the woodies are still on the bases.', '2008-08-15 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4890282, 710197, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nice capture but unlike many of the other entries there doesn''t seem to be any story?</td>', 'Nice capture but unlike many of the other entries there doesn''t seem to be any story?', '2008-08-15 14:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4890285, 708859, 96721, '<td valign="top">Personally I would have liked a little more light in the scene but I do love the softness of the tools in the background and the border is nice</td>', 'Personally I would have liked a little more light in the scene but I do love the softness of the tools in the background and the border is nice', '2008-08-15 14:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4890300, 709010, 96721, '<td valign="top">This shot is quite nice and has believable poses, the only gripe I have is that with minimal effort you could have hidden the blu-tac / plastercine completely (Batters foot and hand) - but on the whole a really nice shot.</td>', 'This shot is quite nice and has believable poses, the only gripe I have is that with minimal effort you could have hidden the blu-tac / plastercine completely (Batters foot and hand) - but on the whole a really nice shot.', '2008-08-15 14:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4890302, 710137, 96721, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling of solitude without problem, but for some reason the image just doesn''t work for me - Sorry I do not even know why so cannot offer any CC.</td>', 'I get the feeling of solitude without problem, but for some reason the image just doesn''t work for me - Sorry I do not even know why so cannot offer any CC.', '2008-08-15 14:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4890343, 708483, 96721, '<td valign="top">Sorry this really does not work for me, far too glary colours in the middle of the background I think it would have worked better if you had mocked up a church type set, the costumes you are suggesting look completely out of place with the painting you have chosen as a setting.</td>', 'Sorry this really does not work for me, far too glary colours in the middle of the background I think it would have worked better if you had mocked up a church type set, the costumes you are suggesting look completely out of place with the painting you have chosen as a setting.', '2008-08-15 14:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4890345, 710160, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and well composed.</td>', 'Nice lighting and well composed.', '2008-08-15 14:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4890388, 710119, 96721, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, it''s a real shame you can just see blu-tak around the hand as once spotted it draws the eye away from an otherwise nicely executed photo.</td>', 'A nice shot, it''s a real shame you can just see blu-tak around the hand as once spotted it draws the eye away from an otherwise nicely executed photo.', '2008-08-15 15:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4890389, 710255, 96721, '<td valign="top">Good idea but the cup and glass vary in size SO much it''s quite distracting</td>', 'Good idea but the cup and glass vary in size SO much it''s quite distracting', '2008-08-15 15:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4890390, 710257, 96721, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, the dead flower head and the grass cuttings make the top 3rd look a bit messy pulling the eye away from your main subject.</td>', 'Nice colours, the dead flower head and the grass cuttings make the top 3rd look a bit messy pulling the eye away from your main subject.', '2008-08-15 15:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4890398, 710063, 96721, '<td valign="top">Fun idea, however the Duvet is massively over sized and the image looks a little flat to me.<br/> <br/>If you were to reshoot this I would consider trying to create a bedroom style lighting and use more scaled bed covers.</td>', 'Fun idea, however the Duvet is massively over sized and the image looks a little flat to me. If you were to reshoot this I would consider trying to create a bedroom style lighting and use more scaled bed covers.', '2008-08-15 15:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
