(4899356, 709735, 28742, '<td valign="top">ROFL - couldn''t have been beat by a more appropriate entry! This was one of the first I saw and voted on and fav''d it immediately! Congrats on the blue! You rocked the lighting and pulled emotion from an emotionless subject - that''s the key to a good woody shot, IMO. :)</td>', 'ROFL - couldn''t have been beat by a more appropriate entry! This was one of the first I saw and voted on and fav''d it immediately! Congrats on the blue! You rocked the lighting and pulled emotion from an emotionless subject - that''s the key to a good woody shot, IMO. :)', '2008-08-20 03:37:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4899363, 710072, 28742, '<td valign="top">Loved it! Congrats - you did an awesome job replicating Docs pic. Congrats on the ribbon and it''s good to see others now with woodies in their top shots row. :)</td>', 'Loved it! Congrats - you did an awesome job replicating Docs pic. Congrats on the ribbon and it''s good to see others now with woodies in their top shots row. :)', '2008-08-20 03:40:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4899368, 710015, 28742, '<td valign="top">LOL - a classic Irene shot meets the Woody challenge and kicks ass as usual! Well not mine or Rina''s or William''s, but everyone elses dammit. :) Congrats on fourth and THANKS to Leo for goading you and THANKS to you for dumbing it down just enough to allow some of us others to win a ribbon.<br/> <br/>I like Mark''s suggestion about the newspaper, but I think you should also curl up the edges and light it just right as well - curled paper AND water - nobody will even notice the woody. :)</td>', 'LOL - a classic Irene shot meets the Woody challenge and kicks ass as usual! Well not mine or Rina''s or William''s, but everyone elses dammit. :) Congrats on fourth and THANKS to Leo for goading you and THANKS to you for dumbing it down just enough to allow some of us others to win a ribbon. I like Mark''s suggestion about the newspaper, but I think you should also curl up the edges and light it just right as well - curled paper AND water - nobody will even notice the woody. :)', '2008-08-20 03:44:56.000000', NULL, 0),
