(4900308, 709825, 27373, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, not Fetor.  That means I owe you a quick critique, well comment I guess would be better.<br/> <br/>I like the image.  There were a wealth of well thought out images in this challenge.  The pose is great, the lampshade makes the shot.  If the woody had just been posed with the bottle this would''ve been a six (rather than the 8 I gave it).  I don''t like the shadow at the bottom of the shot, and a smoother background (instead of the harsh transition from yellow to white).  I think you''re overall score was hurt by the abundance of funny shots.<br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'Hmmmm, not Fetor.  That means I owe you a quick critique, well comment I guess would be better. I like the image.  There were a wealth of well thought out images in this challenge.  The pose is great, the lampshade makes the shot.  If the woody had just been posed with the bottle this would''ve been a six (rather than the 8 I gave it).  I don''t like the shadow at the bottom of the shot, and a smoother background (instead of the harsh transition from yellow to white).  I think you''re overall score was hurt by the abundance of funny shots. Well done.', '2008-08-20 12:55:36.000000', NULL, 0),
