(4905850, 710114, 30982, '<td valign="top">I should have known this was you!  Perfect!  And has "Shez" written all over it.  Very well executed, from all the crisp, perfect pencil shavings to just the right light.  And yes, I did notice it wasn''t square - that''s the one thing that made me stop and wonder if it was yours!  But the crop is just right the way you have.  Huge congrats on another top ten for your collection and an excellent score!</td>', 'I should have known this was you!  Perfect!  And has "Shez" written all over it.  Very well executed, from all the crisp, perfect pencil shavings to just the right light.  And yes, I did notice it wasn''t square - that''s the one thing that made me stop and wonder if it was yours!  But the crop is just right the way you have.  Huge congrats on another top ten for your collection and an excellent score!', '2008-08-23 09:15:48.000000', NULL, 0),
