(5130669, 710114, 55838, '<td valign="top">Hiya Shez!  I love this image and think it''s beautiful and very creative.  I must admit that, based on the comments you received, I am in the minority in how I interpreted your shot.  I thought it was meant to sweetly depict the special gift that a new bride saved for her soul mate on their wedding night.  I suppose that was silly since Woody is a boy!  : )  Oh well.  Very well done sweet sister!</td>', 'Hiya Shez!  I love this image and think it''s beautiful and very creative.  I must admit that, based on the comments you received, I am in the minority in how I interpreted your shot.  I thought it was meant to sweetly depict the special gift that a new bride saved for her soul mate on their wedding night.  I suppose that was silly since Woody is a boy!  : )  Oh well.  Very well done sweet sister!', '2008-12-14 17:27:33.000000', NULL, 0),
